
### Happy Path

POST http://localhost:5000/api/transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "AccountFrom": "12345678",
    "AccountTo": "12445690",
    "TransferAmount": 56.0,
    "Reference": "{{ $random.uuid }}"
}


